Third-party code: bigfft
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The package internal/bigfft contains code derived from bigfft by
Rémy Oudompheng:

  Source:   https://github.com/remyoudompheng/bigfft
  Revision: 24d4a6f8daece64d3c9a7660d4ee0974c4e31021 (2023-01-29),
            Go module version v0.0.0-20230129092748-24d4a6f8daec
  License:  BSD-3-Clause, reproduced below and kept verbatim in
            internal/bigfft/LICENSE

Derived files, and the upstream file each one comes from:

  internal/bigfft/arith_decl.go     <- arith_decl.go
  internal/bigfft/fermat.go         <- fermat.go
  internal/bigfft/fft.go            <- fft.go
  internal/bigfft/fft_core.go       <- fft.go (fourier, fftmul)
  internal/bigfft/fft_poly.go       <- fft.go (poly, polValues and methods)
  internal/bigfft/fft_recursion.go  <- fft.go (the recursion inside fourier)

The upstream portions of these files remain under the BSD-3-Clause license
below. The modifications to them, and every other Go file of internal/bigfft,
are Copyright 2026 André-Guy Bruneau and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Each derived file opens with a header listing what it took from
upstream and what was changed. Upstream's scan.go (removed from this
repository, ADR-0009 R1) and upstream's test files are not included.

